text: ['All creatures get -3/-3 until end of turn.\\nYou may cast a spell with mana value 3 or less from your hand without paying its mana cost.', 'When Quicksmith Rebel enters the battlefield, target artifact you control gains "{T}: This artifact deals 2 damage to any target" for as long as you control Quicksmith Rebel.', 'When Trophy Mage enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an artifact card with mana value 3, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Whenever Scrap Trawler or another artifact you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return to your hand target artifact card in your graveyard with lesser mana value.']
flavor: ['"Let\'s add just a bit more stopping power."']
